&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;(3) 【株主総会決議又は取締役会決議に基づかないものの内容】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:359.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-size:9.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
